WEBVTT

00:00.780 --> 00:02.520
<i>My name is Yuzaki Nasa.</i>

00:03.100 --> 00:05.150
<i>My wife's name is Tsukasa.</i>

00:05.490 --> 00:07.440
<i>On a night when the moon was shining bright,</i>

00:07.700 --> 00:10.400
<i>a certain girl saved my life.</i>

00:10.860 --> 00:16.100
<i>And that really cute girl would one day be 
the wife with whom I would share a future!</i>

00:16.700 --> 00:19.990
<i>I fell in love at first sight, and proposed
 to her the same day we met.</i>

00:20.670 --> 00:25.280
<i>And trusting how earnest I seemed 
to be, she one day returned to me.</i>

00:26.360 --> 00:29.960
<i>This is the story of a couple 
who had a strange first meeting,</i>

00:29.960 --> 00:34.010
<i>and ended up together with an 
irreplaceable bond between them.</i>

01:15.550 --> 01:24.310
TONIKAWA

01:15.550 --> 01:24.310
TONIKAWA

02:05.520 --> 02:11.020
<b>Episode 4      Spots to Kiss</b>

02:06.000 --> 02:09.180
<i>My husband is a man you can rely on.</i>

02:09.730 --> 02:12.980
<i>He's not physically imposing, 
nor all that strong.</i>

02:13.390 --> 02:14.310
<i>And yet...</i>

02:15.040 --> 02:16.480
Senpai!

02:18.070 --> 02:19.210
What's wrong?

02:19.210 --> 02:21.870
I was hoping you could help me.

02:21.870 --> 02:24.870
You think you can fix this thing?

02:25.880 --> 02:27.620
A vacuum, huh?

02:27.620 --> 02:30.630
It suddenly won't turn on anymore.

02:31.680 --> 02:35.500
As long as it's not critically damaged,
 I should be able to.

02:37.270 --> 02:40.260
What exactly would count as
"critical damage," anyway?

02:40.710 --> 02:43.940
Well, if the LSI or any integrated 
circuits are broken,

02:43.940 --> 02:46.520
the odds of fixing it are pretty bad.

02:47.120 --> 02:50.490
But that stuff usually doesn't break.

02:50.490 --> 02:51.650
I see...

02:52.520 --> 02:55.920
I'd say 80-90% of the time, it's a 
problem with the electrical systems.

02:55.920 --> 02:59.460
Usually either some soldering came 
loose or a cord's been broken...

02:59.460 --> 03:03.170
Maybe even some parts rusting. Most of 
the time, it's something like that.

03:04.300 --> 03:05.150
Here you go.

03:05.150 --> 03:07.040
Oh, thank you.

03:09.230 --> 03:13.170
This means the solder point here is loose...

03:13.600 --> 03:15.520
So we fill it in a little.

03:20.170 --> 03:21.680
There you go. It's working.

03:24.500 --> 03:27.370
You're such a big help, Senpai!

03:28.120 --> 03:29.680
I'm just glad I could get it working.

03:30.090 --> 03:34.690
I have a request for the 
ever-helpful Nasa-kun!

03:34.980 --> 03:35.940
Aya-san?

03:35.940 --> 03:37.580
What do you want?

03:37.580 --> 03:41.100
I'll have you know I'm in a bit of a pinch! 
More than a bit! A <i>huge</i> pinch, in fact!

03:42.050 --> 03:45.570
I've got finals coming up 
at the end of the month!

03:47.000 --> 03:50.580
What was that sigh for?! How do you 
already know where this is going?!

03:51.010 --> 03:54.640
However, as you have guessed, 
I haven't studied at all!

03:54.640 --> 03:58.590
My attendance is pretty bad, too, so Aya's 
in a real "fail the year" kinda pinch!

03:58.850 --> 04:02.320
I can't afford a failing grade! I'll fail the year!

04:02.320 --> 04:05.080
This may be Aya's biggest 
and most painful pinch yet!

04:05.080 --> 04:06.470
You get what you deserve.

04:06.710 --> 04:08.300
From what I was able to figure out,

04:08.300 --> 04:09.690
the trend for getting grades up

04:09.690 --> 04:13.880
is asking a smart friend instead of 
going to cram school or getting a tutor!

04:13.880 --> 04:16.480
That's how it works in 
both <i>Magazine</i> and <i>Jump</i>!

04:16.480 --> 04:18.480
So teach me, Nasa-kun!

04:18.730 --> 04:21.380
Uh, I only graduated middle school.

04:21.380 --> 04:24.990
Teaching a high school student 
when I never went to high school is—

04:24.990 --> 04:26.980
But you're smart!

04:26.980 --> 04:29.260
So I'm sure you can teach real good!

04:30.400 --> 04:32.000
Can I, though?

04:32.000 --> 04:34.500
Why not take a look at her 
books to get a better idea?

04:36.290 --> 04:38.000
Can you show them to me?

04:38.400 --> 04:39.470
Yay!

04:40.020 --> 04:41.650
Math III

04:41.850 --> 04:45.260
<i>I dunno, though... 
I mean, high school material...</i>

04:47.000 --> 04:48.420
Nasa-kun...

04:48.420 --> 04:53.930
You just thought, "Wait, how can she not 
understand such simple material?" Didn't you?

04:54.990 --> 04:57.280
I... wouldn't go that far.

04:57.280 --> 04:59.190
But you did think it was easy, didn't you?

04:59.930 --> 05:02.490
If this is as hard as it gets... yeah.

05:02.490 --> 05:04.070
Th-Then can you teach me?

05:04.330 --> 05:08.050
Well... I don't really know 
where you're at right now,

05:08.050 --> 05:10.320
so could you show me some of your quizzes?

05:10.320 --> 05:11.580
Okay!

05:14.340 --> 05:16.710
Th-This is really... something.

05:16.710 --> 05:17.430
Tee-hee!

05:17.430 --> 05:19.080
Don't you "tee-hee" us.

05:19.080 --> 05:21.090
But studying is so...

05:21.090 --> 05:22.410
Yeah, yeah...

05:22.410 --> 05:23.340
Okay.

05:23.720 --> 05:27.770
I'm going to put together a series 
of once-daily worksheets for you.

05:27.770 --> 05:30.350
Can you promise to work on them 
until you've got them memorized?

05:30.670 --> 05:32.400
Will that be enough?

05:32.400 --> 05:34.640
Yep. That's all you have to do.

05:34.640 --> 05:38.520
We'll start tomorrow, so could 
you bring all your books in?

05:38.520 --> 05:39.860
Okay!

05:40.140 --> 05:41.630
Are you sure about this?

05:41.630 --> 05:45.240
It should be fine. Especially if the 
goal is just to not fail on her finals.

05:45.830 --> 05:49.990
I've got a knack for predicting 
the questions on exams.

05:50.340 --> 05:54.720
If you look at the statistics for past tests 
and imagine the mindset of the test writers,

05:54.720 --> 05:57.500
you can pretty easily stay 
one step ahead of them.

05:57.840 --> 06:00.580
It's utilizing this ability to its full extent

06:00.580 --> 06:03.000
that got me ranked #1 in the nation!

06:03.570 --> 06:10.010
<i>I was asking about the work that 
he'd have to sink into this, actually.</i>

06:10.370 --> 06:13.510
<i>But my darling doesn't even 
consider that kind of thing.</i>

06:14.280 --> 06:16.560
<i>When people say someone is reliable,</i>

06:16.560 --> 06:19.520
<i>they probably mean people who 
don't expect anything in return.</i>

06:20.330 --> 06:21.520
So that means...

06:21.900 --> 06:24.070
The answer should be three.

06:24.070 --> 06:26.720
This is so hard...

06:26.720 --> 06:29.530
I'll explain again from the beginning, then.

06:29.920 --> 06:35.040
Honestly, Nasa-kun, how can you even 
memorize these long chains of weird codes?

06:36.600 --> 06:38.700
They're not weird chains.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.820
Each one of these formulas represents

06:41.820 --> 06:46.800
the history of mathematicians, 
who were all seeking answers.

06:47.340 --> 06:51.290
For example, calculus is the 
result of work Newton did

06:51.290 --> 06:55.170
prior to his discovery of gravity
 by applying Kepler's laws.

06:55.170 --> 06:57.630
Then there's the relationship 
between energy and mass,

06:57.630 --> 07:00.490
which Einstein expressed as E = mc²,

07:00.490 --> 07:04.570
something he came up with after 
studying light for over a decade.

07:04.870 --> 07:09.890
These formulas are the results of 
decades, centuries, even millennia

07:09.890 --> 07:12.570
of humanity's knowledge. 
They're fragments of wisdom.

07:13.280 --> 07:17.580
The fact that we only have to memorize them 
is thanks to the work of our predecessors.

07:17.910 --> 07:20.330
Wouldn't you feel bad if you got it wrong?

07:21.790 --> 07:23.830
I-I think I'll keep at it a bit longer.

07:24.140 --> 07:28.590
That's the spirit! So, like I said,
 from the top again...

07:28.880 --> 07:32.370
<i>My husband is a lovely man.</i>

07:32.370 --> 07:34.670
<i>He's capable of doing so much on his own,</i>

07:34.670 --> 07:37.600
<i>but he never thinks those things are 
the sole result of just his efforts.</i>

07:38.040 --> 07:41.280
<i>He has gratitude and respect 
for those who came before him.</i>

07:41.280 --> 07:43.750
<i>That's really cool of him.</i>

07:47.330 --> 07:50.740
<i>My wife is really kind.</i>

07:50.740 --> 07:54.620
<i>She pays a lot of attention to other 
people, and is considerate of them.</i>

07:55.590 --> 07:56.490
Darling?

07:57.360 --> 07:58.300
What's up?

07:58.300 --> 08:00.750
Is this another worksheet for Aya-san?

08:00.750 --> 08:03.500
Nope. I made all of those already.

08:03.880 --> 08:06.500
The rest will depend on how hard she tries.

08:06.830 --> 08:11.510
What I'm doing now is a putting together 
an HR system for a senpai of mine.

08:11.890 --> 08:15.010
They're going independent and
 getting into the VTuber business!

08:15.390 --> 08:17.270
You're interested in that stuff, aren't you?

08:17.270 --> 08:19.590
I'd say so, but...

08:19.590 --> 08:22.520
Darling, you've been sitting 
like that this whole time.

08:23.040 --> 08:24.520
That is true, yeah.

08:24.770 --> 08:27.170
And yet you're still banging on that keyboard

08:27.170 --> 08:29.530
without ever taking a break.

08:29.530 --> 08:31.530
Doesn't it wear you out?

08:31.940 --> 08:35.280
I guess my shoulders and back do kinda hurt.

08:37.760 --> 08:40.850
Darling. I need you to stop working for a sec.

08:41.660 --> 08:43.810
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

08:43.810 --> 08:47.940
Yeah, you are definitely stiff as a rock.

08:47.940 --> 08:49.240
What?! What was that?!

08:49.240 --> 08:51.920
You're going to end up 
hurting yourself someday.

08:52.350 --> 08:56.930
And that being the case, darling, take off
 your hoodie and lie down right here.

08:58.500 --> 09:00.180
I'm gonna give you a massage.

09:00.510 --> 09:03.500
Aw, that's fine! I'd feel 
guilty for troubling you!

09:03.500 --> 09:05.190
Less quibbling and more laying down!

09:06.580 --> 09:10.690
Don't worry about it so much. 
We're married, remember?

09:15.440 --> 09:20.210
I don't think I've ever gotten 
a massage like this before.

09:20.210 --> 09:24.710
Really? Well, good for you. 
That means I'm your first.

09:25.260 --> 09:26.710
Okay, I'm starting.

09:27.250 --> 09:30.960
<i>I can't see Tsukasa-chan behind me, but...</i>

09:31.280 --> 09:34.970
<i>Her slender fingers are 
rubbing my body so forcefully.</i>

09:35.780 --> 09:37.970
<i>This is a lot more exciting than I expected!</i>

09:38.320 --> 09:39.500
How's that?

09:39.500 --> 09:41.970
It feels really good.

09:43.520 --> 09:45.980
This is kind of an awkward position.

09:48.660 --> 09:49.480
O-Oh, my!

09:49.720 --> 09:52.230
Don't move now, darling.

09:54.040 --> 09:56.620
You are very stiff, sir.

09:56.620 --> 09:59.740
You should really be a little 
more health-conscious!

10:00.010 --> 10:02.120
I-I'll try.

10:05.170 --> 10:09.640
<i>Gotta admit, I had no idea 
massages could feel this good.</i>

10:09.640 --> 10:13.880
<i>Something about having Tsukasa-chan 
touch me all over like this...</i>

10:14.880 --> 10:17.760
<i>I wanna give </i>her<i> a massage!</i>

10:17.760 --> 10:20.890
<i>Wait, no, I don't mean anything dirty by that!</i>

10:20.890 --> 10:23.630
<i>It's just, I'd feel bad if 
I didn't return the favor...</i>

10:24.910 --> 10:28.790
Okay, let's finish off with a hand massage.

10:28.790 --> 10:30.150
Turn around for me.

10:38.980 --> 10:40.910
This is kind of embarrassing.

10:42.000 --> 10:42.910
Is it?

10:46.270 --> 10:48.350
There, and now...

10:49.680 --> 10:50.830
All done.

10:52.640 --> 10:55.020
How's that? Feeling a little better?

10:55.020 --> 10:57.550
Y-Yeah. And I was wondering...

10:58.490 --> 11:01.220
I want to give you a massage, too.

11:02.800 --> 11:05.470
I want you to feel good, too!

11:06.970 --> 11:08.850
I appreciate the thought, but...

11:08.850 --> 11:12.090
I tend to heal fast and never get sick,

11:12.090 --> 11:14.800
so I don't get too stiff.

11:15.480 --> 11:18.240
H-Hang on, don't be so 
obviously disappointed!

11:18.820 --> 11:21.360
Okay, then...

11:21.360 --> 11:25.240
Maybe a shoulder rub would be good?

11:25.620 --> 11:26.930
Thank you!

11:26.930 --> 11:30.250
I'm gonna try real hard to 
make you feel good, okay?!

11:30.560 --> 11:34.250
Okay. But mind your phrasing, please.

11:36.370 --> 11:40.010
<i>When my wife pulls her hair back 
and shows the nape of her neck...</i>

11:40.390 --> 11:43.070
<i>It's like... peak housewife stuff.</i>

11:43.610 --> 11:45.600
Okay... here I go.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.120
Y-Yeah...

11:47.120 --> 11:48.610
I'm really gonna do it, okay?

11:48.610 --> 11:50.140
Yeah, I get it! Just come on!

11:56.780 --> 11:59.290
<i>I've never touched her 
shoulders like this before.</i>

11:59.290 --> 12:01.950
<i>They're so soft, but warm...</i>

12:02.590 --> 12:03.660
Darling!

12:04.580 --> 12:05.910
What's wrong?

12:06.370 --> 12:10.200
I get nervous when people touch me.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.160
So, well...

12:13.060 --> 12:15.420
Be gentle, okay?

12:17.230 --> 12:19.170
I-I'll try!

12:22.970 --> 12:24.680
H-How's that?

12:27.970 --> 12:31.200
I didn't think I needed it,

12:31.200 --> 12:33.260
but this does feel really good.

12:34.050 --> 12:35.940
Thank you, darling.

12:36.250 --> 12:37.110
Sure!

12:37.870 --> 12:40.840
<i>My wife is so cute!</i>

12:41.360 --> 12:42.410
<i>And...</i>

12:48.600 --> 12:50.950
<i>She's just really cute!</i>

12:53.210 --> 12:58.080
How many times do you and 
Tsukassan kiss every day, Senpai?

12:59.830 --> 13:04.440
I'm asking for nitty-gritty details about 
your marriage's physical intimacy, is all.

13:04.440 --> 13:06.220
Could you not, please?

13:06.660 --> 13:08.070
See, the thing is,

13:08.070 --> 13:12.430
I was going down a YouTube rabbit hole, 
looking for the sexiest material I could find...

13:12.430 --> 13:15.230
What on earth made you do 
that in the first place?

13:15.610 --> 13:19.630
And there was this ex-athlete 
lady whose channel came up.

13:19.630 --> 13:22.230
And as for the content there...

13:22.540 --> 13:28.060
A video from a reality show talked about how 
many times she and her husband kissed in a day!

13:28.060 --> 13:29.490
And wow, it was really something!

13:29.490 --> 13:32.920
They kiss like nuts, I'm telling you!
 All over the place!

13:32.920 --> 13:35.750
It's real smooch-smooch-smoochie 
smooch-smooch-smooching!

13:34.060 --> 13:35.750
I get it. Please stop now.

13:36.080 --> 13:39.130
So after I finished it, I got curious...

13:39.130 --> 13:42.090
How is it for you?

13:42.090 --> 13:45.260
How many times do the 
Yuzakis do it in a day?!

13:45.620 --> 13:48.260
Could you not wonder that kind of thing?!

13:48.550 --> 13:51.180
So, for real though, how many times?!

13:51.180 --> 13:54.510
How many times do you and Tsukassan 
get that tongue action going on

13:54.510 --> 13:57.040
as you slurp on each other's lips?!

13:57.040 --> 13:59.770
Could you not describe things 
as disturbingly as possible?!

14:00.300 --> 14:03.440
You say that, but I think it's a good thing.

14:03.440 --> 14:04.520
What is?

14:04.520 --> 14:06.690
A married couple should get along well.

14:06.690 --> 14:10.160
And if you get along, isn't it 
natural to be more intimate?

14:11.540 --> 14:15.240
Which is why Kaname-chan 
here has a hot tip for you!

14:16.150 --> 14:19.790
Did you know you could kiss 
more places than the lips?

14:21.180 --> 14:22.570
What exactly do you mean?

14:22.570 --> 14:28.360
This is something I found while trying to 
find the sexiest images I could on Twitter...

14:28.360 --> 14:31.180
Seriously, what goes through 
your head when you do this?

14:32.510 --> 14:37.180
Apparently the meaning behind a kiss 
varies depending on where it lands!

14:39.440 --> 14:41.560
A kiss on the ear, for instance!

14:41.560 --> 14:43.690
It's supposed to be seductive.

14:44.080 --> 14:46.070
A kiss to the throat represents need.

14:46.350 --> 14:48.570
A kiss on the palm is supplication.

14:48.820 --> 14:53.330
And a kiss on the shin is a sign of obedience!

14:53.330 --> 14:55.080
Is that hot or what?!

14:55.330 --> 14:58.080
Y-Yeah, I guess...

14:58.640 --> 15:01.100
Which is why I have poured 
my heart and soul

15:01.100 --> 15:03.840
into collating the kiss data 
I've collected for you.

15:03.840 --> 15:06.170
It's yours now,

15:06.170 --> 15:10.080
so I hope you can enjoy more profound 
physical intimacy with your wife!

15:10.080 --> 15:13.600
C-Come on, I don't need this 
weirdly specific kind of help!

15:14.220 --> 15:15.790
Don't want it, then?

15:16.510 --> 15:20.020
<b>List

•Kiss on the hair                   Longing
•Kiss on the forehead            Blessing
•Kiss on the cheek                     Trust
•Kiss on the ear                  Seduction
•Kiss on the nose                Good Will
•Kiss on the lips                 Attraction
•Kiss on the chin      Embarrassment
•Kiss on the throat                    Need
•Kiss on the wrist                    Desire
•Kiss on the arm             Attachment
•Kiss on the chest                   Passion
•Kiss on the palm          Supplication
•Kiss on the fingertips    Admiration
•Kiss on the waist                  Binding
•Kiss on the shin               Obedience</b>

15:17.190 --> 15:20.020
S-Since you made it, I'll take it...

15:26.820 --> 15:29.480
<i>So the meaning changes 
depending on the location...</i>

15:30.250 --> 15:31.150
Darling.

15:31.420 --> 15:32.300
Yes?!

15:32.850 --> 15:35.760
I need some vegetables, so I'm 
gonna head to the supermarket.

15:35.760 --> 15:39.410
Oh, in that case, I'll go, too. It's kind of late.

15:39.880 --> 15:42.170
<i>And I need to cool off...</i>

15:51.680 --> 15:54.550
Since we're out, let's take a detour back.

15:55.770 --> 15:57.680
It's an evening stroll date.

15:57.680 --> 15:58.490
Sure.

16:03.720 --> 16:07.420
<i>I don't mind taking walks at night like this.</i>

16:07.420 --> 16:11.490
<i>When there's a faint breeze, 
and we're walking outside...</i>

16:11.490 --> 16:13.450
<i>When we're walking outside...</i>

16:14.350 --> 16:18.470
<i>I can catch the faint, sweet smell 
coming from Tsukasa-chan's hair!</i>

16:18.470 --> 16:19.600
Darling...

16:20.420 --> 16:22.460
What are you sniffing at?

16:22.460 --> 16:24.830
W-Well, I just... It's...

16:26.600 --> 16:31.250
Y-Your hair smells nice, so I was sniffing it.

16:32.320 --> 16:37.040
It's really charming how, despite being smart,
 at times you really don't seem that way.

16:37.040 --> 16:38.670
Was that even a compliment?!

16:38.670 --> 16:39.560
Still...

16:40.690 --> 16:43.850
You could've just asked, 
and I'd let you touch it.

16:45.190 --> 16:46.350
For real?!

16:46.350 --> 16:48.680
W-Well, yeah.

16:48.680 --> 16:50.360
Th-Then...

16:50.790 --> 16:52.900
Can I touch your hair?

16:57.380 --> 16:59.120
G-Go ahead.

16:59.460 --> 17:01.120
O-Okay, then.

17:06.240 --> 17:08.630
Your hair is really silky, Tsukasa-chan.

17:08.900 --> 17:11.130
Th-Thanks...

17:12.590 --> 17:16.760
<i>A kiss on the ear, for instance! 
It's supposed to be seductive.</i>

17:19.360 --> 17:21.510
<i>A kiss to the throat represents need.</i>

17:24.480 --> 17:27.020
<i>A kiss on the palm is supplication.</i>

17:27.390 --> 17:28.570
Darling?

17:29.460 --> 17:30.980
T-Tsukasa-chan!

17:30.980 --> 17:32.890
Wh-Whoa, hang on!

17:33.770 --> 17:36.840
I mean... what if someone 
sees us? It'd be embarrassing.

17:36.840 --> 17:39.530
But it's so dark out. It's probably fine.

17:39.820 --> 17:42.430
No... When you think you can't be seen,

17:42.430 --> 17:45.320
it usually just means you don't 
realize you're being seen.

17:45.320 --> 17:46.520
I see.

17:47.200 --> 17:48.040
But even so,

17:48.480 --> 17:52.050
we're being really careful, 
so I think it might be fine!

17:53.710 --> 17:58.770
Also, we're already married! So even if 
someone does see, we're in the clear, right?

17:58.770 --> 18:03.660
It's really charming how, despite being smart,
 at times you really don't seem that way.

18:03.660 --> 18:05.680
Again, is that supposed 
to be a compliment?!

18:09.900 --> 18:10.940
What is it?

18:15.660 --> 18:16.820
It's Yanagi-sensei!

18:17.170 --> 18:20.170
Isn't that the guy from the theme park?

18:20.170 --> 18:22.200
Yeah. Taniguchi-sensei.

18:22.490 --> 18:24.000
They seem to getting along.

18:24.000 --> 18:25.080
Sure do.

18:33.020 --> 18:34.280
W-Was that—

18:34.280 --> 18:36.590
They're already like that?!

18:36.880 --> 18:39.590
Does this mean the confession 
actually worked?!

18:39.840 --> 18:41.440
Wh-Wh-What do we do?

18:41.440 --> 18:43.080
I-I-I'm not sure!

18:43.080 --> 18:44.690
Let's get out of here, fast!

18:44.690 --> 18:46.350
But we can't move, not now!

19:05.780 --> 19:08.540
<i>That was such a shock...</i>

19:09.410 --> 19:10.380
Darling?

19:12.050 --> 19:14.380
Kaname gave us these.

19:15.550 --> 19:19.600
She's really generous, the way 
she always shares with us.

19:19.600 --> 19:21.010
Th-That she is...

19:24.770 --> 19:26.390
They're good and sweet, aren't they?

19:28.080 --> 19:28.890
They are!

19:29.950 --> 19:33.380
<i>According to the data, a kiss 
on the eyelid is for yearning...</i>

19:33.380 --> 19:35.520
<i>And a kiss on the back of 
the hand is for affection!</i>

19:36.210 --> 19:37.890
Hey, come to think of it...

19:37.890 --> 19:43.760
She gave me a list of different kiss locations 
and their meanings along with the grapes.

19:44.370 --> 19:49.290
<b>List

•Kiss on the hair                   Longing
•Kiss on the forehead            Blessing
•Kiss on the cheek                     Trust
•Kiss on the ear                  Seduction
•Kiss on the nose                Good Will
•Kiss on the lips                 Attraction
•Kiss on the chin      Embarrassment
•Kiss on the throat                     Need
•Kiss on the wrist                     Desire</b>

19:45.270 --> 19:47.640
She gave that to you, too?!

19:47.640 --> 19:49.290
Wait, she gave it to you, too?

19:49.290 --> 19:51.490
That girl, seriously...

19:51.490 --> 19:53.770
It's pretty interesting, though.

19:53.770 --> 19:56.640
People are always thinking about this 
kind of thing, no matter the age.

19:57.760 --> 20:01.420
Apparently the cheek is for trust, 
and the arm for attachment.

20:06.960 --> 20:09.180
U-Uh, Nasa-kun?

20:09.180 --> 20:11.940
A kiss on the throat is supposed 
to represent need...

20:12.260 --> 20:15.500
Jeez, where did that come from?

20:16.300 --> 20:18.440
In that case, I'll...

20:22.930 --> 20:25.950
A kiss on the ear is supposed 
to be for seduction.

20:30.900 --> 20:33.580
Tsukasa-chan, can I see your hand?

20:35.510 --> 20:36.460
Like this?

20:39.400 --> 20:41.710
<i>A kiss on the wrist shows desire.</i>

20:43.140 --> 20:44.970
<i>The palm is supplication.</i>

20:46.000 --> 20:47.720
<i>Fingertips are for admiration.</i>

20:49.210 --> 20:51.580
<i>A kiss to the forehead is a blessing.</i>

20:53.780 --> 20:55.730
<i>And on top of the head is longing.</i>

20:57.190 --> 21:00.110
What else was there?

21:00.560 --> 21:04.360
There's also... the chest... and the stomach.

21:04.760 --> 21:07.370
The chest and the stomach, huh?

21:07.880 --> 21:11.370
Is it okay if I do it from 
on top of your clothes?

21:11.950 --> 21:13.320
I guess...

21:13.880 --> 21:16.370
But what's it mean?

21:18.260 --> 21:19.660
I forget.

21:31.510 --> 21:34.480
Senpai, do you two ever make out in the park?

21:35.890 --> 21:40.900
Well, the other night, I saw you go for it,
 but then Tsukassan stopped you,

21:40.900 --> 21:43.030
and instead you sniffed her hair a bunch.

21:43.650 --> 21:45.260
You saw all that, Kaname-chan?!

21:45.260 --> 21:47.950
Well, of course I did!

21:47.950 --> 21:49.640
Everybody did.

21:49.640 --> 21:50.980
What?!

21:51.410 --> 21:54.950
<i>I remember thinking we shouldn't
 fool around outside anymore.</i>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>Closed for the Day</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>Sorry!</b>

23:24.960 --> 23:39.930
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

23:25.650 --> 23:27.960
The relaxing effects of 
a hot spring are amazing!

23:27.960 --> 23:30.160
Even better than music and 
aromatherapy, they say!

23:30.160 --> 23:32.550
Getting away from the 
city probably helps, too.

23:32.550 --> 23:34.930
Hot springs really are relaxing.

23:34.930 --> 23:35.930
But then...

23:36.240 --> 23:39.980
Why are we both feeling so nervous instead?
